sad-chrono-tz
Copyright 2026 Sadco Security Team

This project is a maintained fork of the chrono-tz workspace (`chrono-tz`,
`chrono-tz-build`, and `parse-zoneinfo`), API-compatible for the verified
runtime surface of the `chrono-tz 0.10.4` release line and carrying IANA tzdb
updates and security and robustness fixes.

